    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Download now and explore VAIL\u2019s free-to-play Citadel and get VAIL Combat to engage in high-intensity battles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">VAIL CITADEL (FREE-TO-PLAY)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover why VAIL is the highest rated VR Shooter with best-in-class mechanics, precisely tuned interactions, and immersive physics systems. Challenge others to intense 1v1 battles, get the best score in mini-golf, or discover the mysteries in the quarry \u2014 The Citadel is constantly being updated with new features and content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801550/extras/14becbbf63ddb294519425a98491acf2.poster.avif?t=1738883866\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801550/extras/14becbbf63ddb294519425a98491acf2.webm?t=1738883866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801550/extras/14becbbf63ddb294519425a98491acf2.mp4?t=1738883866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ORE deposits are scattered throughout the Quarry waiting for you to mine in an all new CO-OP PVE mode. But be careful, because as soon as you start extracting the valuable ORE shards, an enemy is waiting to... give you a hug? ORE can be spent on exclusive cosmetics and to unlock VAIL Combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801550/extras/c61d7d52a4b98edee67edda89dc48fd9.poster.avif?t=1738883866\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801550/extras/c61d7d52a4b98edee67edda89dc48fd9.webm?t=1738883866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801550/extras/c61d7d52a4b98edee67edda89dc48fd9.mp4?t=1738883866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">VAIL COMBAT (DLC)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gain access to everything VAIL has to offer. Dominate in popular team-based and free-for-all game modes as you level up, unlock rewards, and top the leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801550/extras/4d750403457a9f969b793827f39a57b3.poster.avif?t=1738883866\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801550/extras/4d750403457a9f969b793827f39a57b3.webm?t=1738883866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801550/extras/4d750403457a9f969b793827f39a57b3.mp4?t=1738883866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover VAIL's story as you traverse through awe-inspiring brutalist environments and the lines between right and wrong begin to blur.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801550/extras/c9fab025e23412e360668872248eda8c.poster.avif?t=1738883866\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801550/extras/c9fab025e23412e360668872248eda8c.webm?t=1738883866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801550/extras/c9fab025e23412e360668872248eda8c.mp4?t=1738883866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BUT WAIT THERE'S MORE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">VAIL Combat (DLC) will also include future game modes that are currently in development, such as an upcoming extraction mode. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801550/extras/5e82467683e87edbf22d78107cbb7a20.poster.avif?t=1738883866\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801550/extras/5e82467683e87edbf22d78107cbb7a20.webm?t=1738883866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801550/extras/5e82467683e87edbf22d78107cbb7a20.mp4?t=1738883866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CRITICALLY ACCLAIMED</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801550/extras/15fd0e6c61fa8d9b025a4ed44c909fda.avif?t=1738883866\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
